# @mithra/web architecture

- Feature folders only under `src/features/{auth,marketing,storefront,onboarding,dashboard}`
- Shared UI/primitives in `src/shared/**`; app wiring in `src/app/**`
- Route shells map to static HTML: `/` → index, `/store` → store, `/onboarding` → onboarding, `/dashboard` → dashboard
- Do not invent parallel tokens — extend `src/styles/global.css` (mirrors `assets/css/global.css`)
- Auth via Zustand `useAuthStore`; HTTP via `shared/lib/axios`; forms via `useZodForm`
- Keep business pages out until explicitly requested — use `ArchitectureShell` placeholders
